      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "第3题 高炉炼铁是重要的工业过程.冶炼过程中涉及如下反应:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "(1) $\\mathrm { FeO ( s ) + CO ( g ) \\ Fe ( s ) + CO _ { 2 } ( g ) }$ $K _ { 1 } ^ { \\ominus } \\ = 1.00 \\ \\left( T \\ = 1200 \\mathrm { K } \\right)$ (2) $\\mathrm { FeO ( s ) } + \\mathrm { C ( s ) } \\mathrm { Fe ( s ) } + \\mathrm { CO ( g ) }$ $K _ { 2 } ^ { \\ominus }$ ( = 1200K)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "气体常数 $R = 8.314 \\mathrm { J } \\mathrm { mol } ^ { - 1 } \\mathrm { K } ^ { - 1 }$ ;相关的热力学数据(298K)列入下表:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "<table><tr><td></td><td>FeO(s)</td><td>Fe(s)</td><td>C(s,石墨)</td><td>CO(g)</td><td>CO2(g)</td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta_{\\text{f}}H_{m}^{\\ominus}/\\text{kJmol}^{-1}$ </td><td>-272.0</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-110.5</td><td>-393.5</td></tr><tr><td> $S_{m}^{\\ominus}/\\text{Jmol}^{-1}\\text{K}^{-1}$ </td><td>60.75</td><td>27.3</td><td>5.74</td><td>/</td><td>x</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
      "type": "subpart",
      "label": "3-1",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "假设上述反应体系在密闭条件下达平衡时总压为1200kPa,计算各气体的分压."
        }
      ],
      "partId": "part-001973"
    },
    {
